{"text": "Soon Ben Rogers came along. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The boy. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Whose laughing Tom feared most. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He was eating an apple. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And pretending to be a big steamboat. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Ding dong dong, he called. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Turning in a slow circle. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Like a boat. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Tom went on whitewashing. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And paid no attention. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> To the steamboat. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Hi, old boy. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> You have to work. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Do you not said Ben. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Tom looked at him. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> As if he were surprised. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And asked. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Why, it is you, Ben. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> What do you call work. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Why, is that not work. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Asked Ben. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Well, maybe it is and maybe it is not said Tom. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> All I know is that it suits Tom Sawyer. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Does a boy get a chance. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> To whitewash a fence. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Every day. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Ben stopped eating his apple. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And watched Tom. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> With new interest.", "alignment": {"characters": ["S", "o", "o", "n", " ", "B", "e", "n", " ", "R", "o", "g", "e", "r", "s", " ", "c", "a", "m", "e", " ", "a", "l", "o", "n", "g", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "T", "h", "e", " ", "b", "o", "y", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "W", "h", "o", "s", "e", " ", "l", "a", "u", "g", "h", "i", "n", "g", " ", "T", "o", "m", " ", "f", "e", "a", "r", "e", "d", " ", "m", "o", "s", "t", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=